--TEST--
a use in the open file and the declaration in a required one come back as one list, each path spelled the way the case wrote it and the list ordered by that spelling, `rule:ide/five-features-are-one-reference-index`
--FILE--
<?nvs
require 'lib/user.nvs';

var $u = new Us<|>er();
echo $u->name;
--FILE lib/user.nvs--
<?nvs
class User
{
    public string $name = "";
}
--REQUEST--
references
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:4:10
lib/user.nvs:2:7
